  description: '1 "Elemental HERO" Fusion Monster + 1+ Warrior monsters

    Must
    be Fusion Summoned. Gains 300 ATK for each material used for its Summon. This
    card can make a number of attacks on monsters each Battle Phase, up to the number
    of Fusion Monsters used as material for its Summon. After damage calculation,
    if this card battled a monster: Destroy that monster, and if you do, inflict
    damage to your opponent equal to its original ATK. If this Fusion Summoned card
    is destroyed: Special Summon 1 Warrior monster from your hand or Deck.'
